---
// Experience, Reviews & Pricing section inspired by Dixon Creative & Shelley B Photography
---

<section id="experience" class="experience-section">
	<div class="experience-grid">
		<div class="experience-col">
			<span class="section-badge">THE EXPERIENCE</span>
			<h2 class="experience-title">Unhurried. Relaxed. <em>Genuinely You.</em></h2>
			<p class="experience-p">
				Taking family portraits on vacation or senior milestones shouldn't feel like high-stress wrangling. 
				We guide you through natural, unforced interactions with the emerald water and soft Gulf breezes as our backdrop.
			</p>

			<div class="team-card">
				<img src="/images/portrait.avif" alt="Shelley Bressman" class="team-img" />
				<div class="team-info">
					<h4>Shelley & Blaine Bressman</h4>
					<p class="team-role">Husband & Wife Photography Team</p>
					<p class="team-bio">
						“I work on composition, lighting and poses, while Blaine watches for those candid, spontaneous smiles. You get two pairs of eyes capturing every angle.”
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="experience-col">
			<span class="section-badge">PRAISE & REVIEWS</span>
			<div class="reviews-slider">
				<div class="review-box">
					<div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
					<blockquote>
						“We had a session on the beach with 10 members of our family. Shelley was wonderful with everyone, including my one-year-old nephew. She arrived early and worked so effortlessly with all of us!”
					</blockquote>
					<cite>— Sarah M., Gulf Shores Vacationer</cite>
				</div>

				<div class="review-box">
					<div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
					<blockquote>
						“Shelley and her husband made the whole process completely stress-free (and we had to coordinate a lot of people and a cranky toddler!). The photos are stunning.”
					</blockquote>
					<cite>— David & Jennifer K., Orange Beach</cite>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>

	<!-- Pricing & Investment Table -->
	<div id="pricing" class="pricing-container">
		<div class="pricing-header">
			<span class="section-badge">COLLECTIONS & INVESTMENT</span>
			<h3 class="pricing-title">Simple, All-Inclusive Session Packages</h3>
			<p class="pricing-subtitle">Each session includes hand-retouched, high-resolution digital files with print release and private online gallery.</p>
		</div>

		<div class="pricing-cards">
			<div class="price-card">
				<span class="tier-name">Sunrise Petite / Senior</span>
				<div class="tier-price">$300<span>+</span></div>
				<p class="tier-desc">Ideal for seniors, milestones, or immediate families wanting quiet morning light.</p>
				<ul class="tier-features">
					<li>✓ 30–45 minute beach or downtown session</li>
					<li>✓ Up to 5 family members or 1 senior</li>
					<li>✓ 15 high-resolution edited images</li>
					<li>✓ Print release & online download</li>
				</ul>
				<a href="#inquire" class="tier-btn">Select Collection</a>
			</div>

			<div class="price-card featured">
				<div class="badge-pop">MOST POPULAR</div>
				<span class="tier-name">Golden Hour Sunset</span>
				<div class="tier-price">$600</div>
				<p class="tier-desc">Our signature family beach experience during breathtaking Gulf Coast sunset lighting.</p>
				<ul class="tier-features">
					<li>✓ 60-minute sunset session</li>
					<li>✓ Up to 10 family members</li>
					<li>✓ Full curated gallery (35+ edited photos)</li>
					<li>✓ 2 Photographers (Shelley & Blaine)</li>
					<li>✓ Complete print release & mobile gallery app</li>
				</ul>
				<a href="#inquire" class="tier-btn primary">Reserve Sunset Date</a>
			</div>

			<div class="price-card">
				<span class="tier-name">Multi-Gen Extended Family</span>
				<div class="tier-price">$800<span>–$1000</span></div>
				<p class="tier-desc">Designed for large family reunions, anniversaries, and multi-generation gatherings.</p>
				<ul class="tier-features">
					<li>✓ 75–90 minute relaxed sunset session</li>
					<li>✓ Up to 25+ family members & all breakout pairings</li>
					<li>✓ 60+ hand-finished heirloom images</li>
					<li>✓ 2 Photographers ensuring no moment is missed</li>
					<li>✓ High-priority turnaround</li>
				</ul>
				<a href="#inquire" class="tier-btn">Inquire Extended</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.experience-section {
		max-width: var(--frame-width);
		margin-inline: auto;
		padding-inline: var(--page-margin);
		padding-block: var(--section-gap);
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
	}

	.experience-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(360px, 1fr));
		gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 5rem);
		align-items: start;
	}

	.section-badge {
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		letter-spacing: 0.15em;
		color: var(--color-accent);
		text-transform: uppercase;
		display: block;
		margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
	}

	.experience-title {
		font-family: var(--font-heading);
		font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 3.5vw, 3.2rem);
		font-weight: 400;
		line-height: 1.15;
		margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
	}

	.experience-title em {
		color: var(--color-accent);
	}

	.experience-p {
		font-size: 1rem;
		line-height: 1.7;
		color: var(--color-text-secondary);
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}

	.team-card {
		display: flex;
		gap: 1.25rem;
		padding: 1.5rem;
		background: #181818;
		border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
		border-radius: var(--radius);
		align-items: center;
	}

	.team-img {
		width: 80px;
		height: 80px;
		border-radius: 50%;
		object-fit: cover;
		border: 2px solid var(--color-accent);
	}

	.team-info h4 {
		font-family: var(--font-heading);
		font-size: 1.2rem;
		margin: 0;
	}

	.team-role {
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-size: 0.7rem;
		color: var(--color-accent);
		text-transform: uppercase;
		margin-top: 2px;
	}

	.team-bio {
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		color: var(--color-text-secondary);
		margin-top: 0.5rem;
		line-height: 1.5;
	}

	.reviews-slider {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 1.5rem;
	}

	.review-box {
		padding: 1.5rem;
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
		border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
		border-radius: var(--radius);
	}

	.stars {
		color: var(--color-accent);
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
	}

	.review-box blockquote {
		font-family: var(--font-serif);
		font-size: 1.15rem;
		line-height: 1.5;
		color: var(--color-text);
		margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
	}

	.review-box cite {
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		color: var(--color-muted);
		text-transform: uppercase;
		font-style: normal;
	}

	/* Pricing */
	.pricing-container {
		margin-top: 5rem;
		padding-top: 4rem;
		border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
	}

	.pricing-header {
		text-align: center;
		max-width: 650px;
		margin-inline: auto;
		margin-bottom: 3rem;
	}

	.pricing-title {
		font-family: var(--font-heading);
		font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 3rem);
		margin: 0.5rem 0 1rem;
	}

	.pricing-subtitle {
		color: var(--color-text-secondary);
		font-size: 0.95rem;
	}

	.pricing-cards {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
		gap: 2rem;
	}

	.price-card {
		background: #161616;
		border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
		border-radius: var(--radius);
		padding: 2.25rem 1.75rem;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		position: relative;
	}

	.price-card.featured {
		border-color: var(--color-accent);
		background: #1b1916;
		box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(201, 169, 110, 0.1);
	}

	.badge-pop {
		position: absolute;
		top: -12px;
		left: 50%;
		transform: translateX(-50%);
		background: var(--color-accent);
		color: #111;
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-size: 0.65rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		padding: 3px 12px;
		border-radius: var(--radius-full);
	}

	.tier-name {
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		letter-spacing: 0.1em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: var(--color-accent);
	}

	.tier-price {
		font-family: var(--font-heading);
		font-size: 2.8rem;
		color: #fff;
		margin: 0.75rem 0;
	}

	.tier-price span {
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		color: var(--color-muted);
	}

	.tier-desc {
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		color: var(--color-text-secondary);
		line-height: 1.5;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}

	.tier-features {
		list-style: none;
		padding: 0;
		margin: 0 0 2rem;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.75rem;
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		color: var(--color-text-secondary);
	}

	.tier-features li {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.5rem;
	}

	.tier-btn {
		margin-top: auto;
		display: block;
		text-align: center;
		padding: 0.75rem;
		border-radius: var(--radius);
		border: 1px solid var(--color-border-strong);
		color: var(--color-text);
		text-decoration: none;
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		font-weight: 500;
		transition: all 0.2s ease;
	}

	.tier-btn:hover {
		border-color: var(--color-accent);
		color: var(--color-accent);
	}

	.tier-btn.primary {
		background: var(--color-accent);
		color: #111;
		border-color: var(--color-accent);
		font-weight: 600;
	}

	.tier-btn.primary:hover {
		background: var(--color-accent-light);
		color: #111;
	}
</style>
